# tally 2.3.1 rulings 17 B, last sentence (G1's review): a `same` group's register lists every side its line
# names: under flows over a span holding the last day (fa: x2 and x3), and under a binding over it, which
# meets it once (ny, sy: y1 and y2). Before: fa x2 alone, ny and sy y1 alone.
=== p10_same_three.tally
model p10
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "probe"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place wa: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place wb: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input d1: date
input d2: date
input d3: date
input a: money PLN

move x1: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from world to wa amount a
move x2: transfers
  on d2
  leg cash from world to wa amount a
move x3: transfers
  on d3
  leg cash from world to wa amount a
move y1: transfers
  on d3
  leg cash from wb to world amount a
move y2: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from wb to world amount a

ask a6: bal(wa, 2026-03-06)
ask a8: bal(wa, 2026-03-08)
ask a9: bal(wa, 2026-03-09)
ask fa: flows(wa, 2026-03-06 .. 2026-03-09)
ask fb: flows(wa, 2026-03-05 .. 2026-03-09)
ask b4: bal(wb, 2026-03-04)
ask b6: bal(wb, 2026-03-06)
ask b9: bal(wb, 2026-03-09)
ask fy: flows(wb, 2026-03)
ask ny: count(t in transfers over 2026-03 where t.cash.from == wb)
ask sy: sum(t.cash.amount for t in transfers over 2026-03 where t.cash.from == wb)
ask ex: explain bal(wb, 2026-03-09)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  opening[wa] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[wb] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  d1 = 2026-03-05 "s"
  d2 = 2026-03-07 "s"
  d3 = 2026-03-09 "s"
  a = 100.00 PLN "s"
  same x1 = x2
  same x2 = x3
  same y1 = y2
=== expect fa fb ny sy
fa: ?"x1, x2 and x3 are one, but leg cash differs on 2026-03-05, 2026-03-07, 2026-03-09: 100.00 PLN (x1), 100.00 PLN (x2) and 100.00 PLN (x3)" (x1, x2, x3)
  unfulfilled: x2
  unfulfilled: x3
  cut 2026-06-10
fb: 100.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: x1
  unfulfilled: x2
  unfulfilled: x3
  cut 2026-06-10
ny: 1
  unfulfilled: y1
  unfulfilled: y2
  cut 2026-06-10
sy: 100.00 PLN
  unfulfilled: y1
  unfulfilled: y2
  cut 2026-06-10
